%description
Quick Launch is an application to search in your current installed applications and launch them

V1.0
- Sending the app to background when launching an app
- Change the way to execute apps, using the internal stuff from nemomobile.lipstick
- Improvement on the focus of the Search field

V1.7 (fork maintained by ozzi-, https://github.com/ozzi-/QuickLaunch)
- Reliable keyboard handling (open, return, tile re-open)
- App-type filter (All / Native / Android), optional filter bar
- Recent apps (persisted, bounded) with reset
- Close-after-launch setting (fast and safe)
- Sailfish OS 5.2 build support

